@ifnottex
@node Top
@top daykeep

This manual is for daykeep (version @value{VERSION}, @value{UPDATED}).
daykeep writes times as a day number plus a fraction of a day.  It sums
time ranges, tracks time as you work, and converts to and from the
calendar.
@end ifnottex

